triage: fix_game: The failures differ from attempt to attempt and each one is a file mistake: empty bookkeeping fields shown to players, attributes nothing updates, unfilled placeholders, and a follow-suit filter that offers cards the game then refuses. Nothing points to a missing platform capability or a flaw in the rules, since per-seat legal options can be built from state.
